      <guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.nytimes.com/2026/07/31/nyregion/starvation-autism-bronx-murder.html</guid>
      <atom:link href="https://www.nytimes.com/2026/07/31/nyregion/starvation-autism-bronx-murder.html" rel="standout"></atom:link>
      <description>A mother and grandmother in the Bronx face charges over the care of twin teenagers with autism. One of the boys weighed 59 pounds when he died. His brother, according to prosecutors, barely survived.</description>
